    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taskbar Integration</strong><br>Minimal UI design allows the game to coexist naturally with your desktop, staying active like any background application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Automated Gameplay</strong><br>Your character continues the adventure automatically\u2014no clicks or repetitive actions required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Reward Box System</strong><br>Reward boxes appear at regular intervals, with a tiny chance to obtain legendary items that could redefine your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Intrusive Design</strong><br>Never interferes with your important tasks. You only need to step in when you want to collect rewards or level up your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightweight</strong><br>Consumes minimal system resources, truly stays with you all day.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taskbar Integration</strong><br>Minimal UI design allows the game to coexist naturally with your desktop, staying active like any background application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Automated Gameplay</strong><br>Your character continues the adventure automatically\u2014no clicks or repetitive actions required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Reward Box System</strong><br>Reward boxes appear at regular intervals, with a tiny chance to obtain legendary items that could redefine your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Intrusive Design</strong><br>Never interferes with your important tasks. You only need to step in when you want to collect rewards or level up your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightweight</strong><br>Consumes minimal system resources, truly stays with you all day.</p>",
    "short_description": "The taskbar is now the stage for our heroes! Support their small but epic adventures. Earn chests through their journeys and unlock powerful gear to strengthen your heroes!",
